<title>USA: Mutual Savings Bank Q4 net off.</title>
<headline>Mutual Savings Bank Q4 net off.</headline>
<dateline>BAY CITY, Mich. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.07		    $0.21</p>
<p> Net			    284			896</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 results include a $156,000 special dividend on stock Mutual Savings Bank owns in a mortgage life reinsurance company and an $88,000 gain on sale of real estate owned. 1995 Q4 includes $1.1 million gain on sale of branch offices and a $214,000 loss on sale of investment and mortgage-backed securities.  </p>
<p>			     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr loss		  $ 0.03     loss	 $0.45</p>
<p> Net loss		     112     loss	 1,886</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 year results include $670,000 loss on sale of an investment in January 1996, and $549,000 gain on sale of bulk mortgage loan servicing.</p>
<p>1995 year results include $2.8 million loss on sale of two mutual fund investments in February 1995.</p>
<p>Assets $664.7 million vs $720.3 million</p>
<p>Deposits $410.3 million vs $427.1 million</p>
<p>Loans serviced for others $537.4 million vs $633.1 million</p>
<p>((-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
